{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"options":{"content":"","images":{},"widgets":{}},"type":"multiple"},"hints":[{"content":"We will solve this by integrating by parts. We know that \n\n$\\qquad\\displaystyle\\int u(x)v\\,^\\prime(x)dx = u(x)v(x)-\\int u\\,^\\prime(x)v(x)dx\\,$.\n\nWe can rewrite this as\n\n$\\qquad\\displaystyle\\int u\\ dv = uv-\\int v\\ du\\,$.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"In this problem we will let $~u = x~$ and $~dv=\\sqrt{x+2}\\, dx\\,$.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Then $~du = dx~$ and $~v = \\dfrac23(x+2)^{3/2}\\,$.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Integration by parts gives\n\n$\\displaystyle\\qquad\\int x\\sqrt{x+2}\\,dx = x\\cdot\\dfrac23(x+2)^{3/2}-\\int\\dfrac23(x+2)^{3/2}\\,dx$\n\n$\\displaystyle\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad=x\\cdot\\dfrac23(x+2)^{3/2}-\\dfrac23\\cdot\\dfrac25(x+2)^{5/2}+C$\n\n$\\displaystyle\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad=x\\cdot\\dfrac23(x+2)^{3/2}-\\dfrac4{15}(x+2)^{5/2}+C\\,$.","images":{},"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Evaluate $~~\\displaystyle\\int x\\sqrt{x+2}\\,dx\\,$.\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\dfrac23(x+2)^{3/2}(x-1)+C$","correct":false},{"content":"$x\\cdot\\dfrac23(x+2)^{3/2}-\\dfrac4{15}(x+2)^{5/2}+C$","correct":true},{"content":"$x\\cdot\\dfrac23(x+2)^{3/2}-\\dfrac2{3}(x+2)^{5/2}+C$","correct":false},{"content":"$x\\cdot\\dfrac23(x+2)^{3/2}+\\dfrac4{15}(x+2)^{5/2}+C$","correct":false}],"displayCount":null,"multipleSelect":false,"noneOfTheAbove":false,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":false},"type":"radio","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
